%% Optional reconciliation is triggered by reading a PENDING checkout, not an invented public reconcile endpoint.
%% Shared settlement deduplicates bank transactions across webhook and reconciliation.
%% A reconciliation exception skips its reread, is caught by getSepayCheckout and preserves polling availability.
%% No match produces no payment mutation. Shared settlement persistence is detailed in PAY-01.
sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Member
    participant UI as SepayCheckoutModal
    participant API as Express middleware / errorHandler
    participant C as paymentsController
    participant S as sepayPaymentsService
    participant DB as Prisma / PostgreSQL
    participant Bank as SePay transaction API
    A->>UI: Wait for transfer result
    loop checkout polling enabled
        UI->>API: GET /api/v1/payments/sepay/:id
        activate API
        API->>API: authenticate and checkFacilityScope
        alt authentication or scope rejected
            API-->>UI: 400 / 401 / 403
        else request accepted
            API->>C: sepayGetCheckout(req, res, next)
            activate C
            C->>S: getSepayCheckout(userId, role, paymentId)
            activate S
            S->>DB: payment.findUnique and verify allowed operator
            DB-->>S: Payment and ownership context
            alt payment missing, wrong gateway or ownership denied
                S-->>C: 403 / 404
            else payment accessible
                opt PENDING and configured reconciliation allowed by throttle
                    S->>Bank: fetchSepayTransactionsByCode(time window)
                    activate Bank
                    Bank-->>S: Transactions or upstream error
                    deactivate Bank
                    S->>S: Match movement and call shared settlement only when matched
                    S->>DB: Reread payment if reconciliation returns normally
                    DB-->>S: Current money and activation states
                end
                S-->>C: Checkout including status, activationStatus and subscriptionId
            end
            deactivate S
            C-->>API: Response or next(error)
            deactivate C
            API-->>UI: 200 checkout or mapped error
        end
        deactivate API
        UI-->>A: Show pending, activated, scheduled or review outcome
    end
%% NESTING_EXCEPTION: polling, HTTP guard, ownership guard and optional reconciliation are independent.
%% Upstream reconciliation errors skip its reread, are caught, and do not alone fail polling.
%% No match does not mutate the payment. Shared settlement internals are PAY-01.
